    "codeLanguage": "javascript",
    "title": "Funzioni freccia",
    "descriptionContent": "Impara a usare le funzioni freccia in JavaScript",
    "shortDescriptionContent": "",
    "showInTrack": true,
    "iconBanner": null,
    "chapters": [
      {
        "id": 17532,
        "title": "Operatore freccia",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 148720,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Impariamo a creare le <strong>funzioni freccia</strong>. Fanno parte dello standard JavaScript ES6 e vengono usate per scrivere codice più pulito e conciso.</p><p>Riscriviamo la funzione qui sotto come funzione freccia usando una sola riga di codice.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"100\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getPlayerSpawnMessage\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Player spawned!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" spawnMessage = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ready!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getPlayerSpawnMessage());\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(spawnMessage());\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>const spawnMessage = () =&gt; \"Ready!\";</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 148721,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Le funzioni freccia sono un tipo di <strong>funzione</strong><strong>anonima</strong>, ovvero non hanno un nome.</p><p>Se vogliamo chiamare queste funzioni, dobbiamo memorizzarle all'interno di una variabile e chiamare la variabile con le parentesi alla fine.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option startIndex=\"146\" endIndex=\"158\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getLevelTitle\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Level 1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" levelTitle = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tutorial Level&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getLevelTitle());\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(levelTitle());\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>const levelTitle</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>levelTitle()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 148722,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Con le funzioni freccia, non abbiamo bisogno della parola chiave <code>function</code> né del nome della funzione. Questo significa che la prima cosa da cui iniziamo sono le parentesi.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"69\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getLevelTitle\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Level 1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" levelTitle = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Boss Level&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>(</code>, seguito da <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 148723,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come per le funzioni normali, possiamo aggiungere parametri tra le parentesi e poi usare i parametri all'interno della funzione.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"102\" /><option startIndex=\"132\" endIndex=\"142\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"formatScore\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"playerName\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Score for &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + playerName;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scoreLabel = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"playerName\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Score for &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + playerName;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(scoreLabel(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>playerName</code>, seguito da <code>playerName</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 148724,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Subito dopo le parentesi e prima della parentesi graffa di apertura aggiungiamo l'operatore freccia <code>=&gt;</code>.</p><p>Usiamo questo operatore subito prima del blocco di codice o dell'espressione che vogliamo far eseguire alla funzione.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"104\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getHealthText = \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"myfunction\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Health: 100&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getHealthTextArrow = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Health: 100&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getHealthText());\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getHealthTextArrow());\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>=&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 148725,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Proprio come con le funzioni tradizionali, usiamo le parentesi graffe <code>{}</code> per contenere il blocco di codice di una funzione freccia.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"71\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getPlayerStatus = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hp = \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;HP: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + hp;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>{</code>, seguito da <code>};</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 148726,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se una arrow function contiene una sola istruzione, possiamo omettere sia le parentesi graffe sia la parola chiave <code>return</code> per ottenere un codice molto breve.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{ return &quot;Game Over&quot; }\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"41\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getGameOverText = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Game Over&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>\"Game Over\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 148727,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dove aggiungiamo l'operatore freccia <code>=&gt;</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Dopo le parentesi e prima della parentesi graffa di apertura</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Dopo la parola chiave <code>function</code> e prima della parentesi graffa di apertura <code>{</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Dopo le parentesi e prima della parentesi graffa di apertura.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 148728,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa fanno le parentesi graffe <code>{}</code> in una arrow function?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Contengono il blocco di codice</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Si usano per chiamare una funzione</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Contengono il blocco di codice.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 148729,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come possiamo abbreviare il codice seguente?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getPauseText = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Paused&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Rimuovendo le parentesi graffe <code>{}</code> e la parola chiave <code>return</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Rimuovendo le parentesi <code>()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Rimuovendo le parentesi graffe <code>{}</code> e la parola chiave <code>return</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 148730,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come chiamiamo la seguente arrow function?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getHUDText = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Score: 20&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>getHUDText();</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>getHUDText;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>getHUDText();</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 148731,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa la funzione freccia.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"var\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"24\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getEnemyCount = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count = \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getEnemyCount());\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>(</code>, seguito da <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 148732,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Codifica l'operatore freccia, <code>=&gt;</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"27\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getEnemyCount = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count = \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getEnemyCount());}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>=&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 148733,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fai in modo che la funzione restituisca il valore <code>400</code> scrivendo la funzione freccia più breve possibile.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"29\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getMaxScore = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"400\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getMaxScore());\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>()</code>, seguito da <code>=&gt;</code> e infine <code>400</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 148734,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Chiama la funzione freccia.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"75\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getStartMessage = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Press Start!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getStartMessage());\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>getStartMessage</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e infine <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}